[[ ## reasoning ## ]]
Both summaries confirm the claim by stating that Keith-Lee Castle played the owner of the doll (Charles Lee Ray) in the 2004 film "Seed of Chucky." Additionally, they correctly identify that both "Seed of Chucky" (2004) and "Child's Play 3" (1991) are part of the "Child's Play" franchise. The reasoning is straightforward, as the summaries align with the claim without any contradictions or additional context needed.

[[ ## query ## ]]
SELECT ?film1 ?film2 WHERE {
  ?film1 rdf:type dbo:Film ;
          dbr:Child's_Play_(franchise) ;
          dbo:releaseDate "2004-01-01"^^xsd:date .
  ?film2 rdf:type dbo:Film ;
          dbr:Child's_Play_(franchise) ;
          dbo:releaseDate "1991-01-01"^^xsd:date .
  ?actor dbo:birthName "Keith-Lee Castle" ;
         dbo:notableWork ?film1 .
}

